  "2026-11-12T20:03:40.720Z",steve-orchestrator,"Orchestrator fixes for the review of cfdec3a: (1) Greptile P1: removeOwnedProject re-pins the project's logical directory inside the admitted queue and refuses with 409 when the workspace or tracker identity differs from the admitted pin, so a deletion that waited never removes storage that an ancestor symlink retarget now names. New route test retargets the user directory symlink while the delete waits: 409, the project row and both storages remain; after restoring the binding the delete succeeds. Without the recheck it returns 200 (fails on revert). (2) capacity fixture close() records an evictPmClient rejection, still ends the database, deletes the fixture rows and the root, then reports FIXTURE_CLIENT_EVICTION_FAILED; setup failure reports cleanup failures in an AggregateError with the original error. Regression stalls the fixture's storage discovery until the real 5 s bound rejects; on revert close() rejects before database.end() and the test process hangs. (3) published-document-links: backslash escapes are removed before splitting the destination, so guide.md\\#section resolves to guide.md; escaped fragment and query cases fail on revert. Gate: projects-routes, capacity-setup, published-document-links (29 pass, all against the disposable pmweb-test-pg), typecheck, lint, duplication (0 pairs)."
